WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.640
What? The Dark Lord... has been revived?!

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:04.860
That's right.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.520
What a joyous piece of news!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.360
Exactly what I'd expect of Your Greatness!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.180
I mean, yeah.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.360
You have blessed us with so much hope.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.110
Truly, you're our savior!

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.050
I mean, yeah.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.420
All that's left is to collect the remaining 
mana crystals and restore the Dark Realm!

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.120
That's right.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:26.750
But before that, we need to investigate 
the motives of who destroyed the Dark Realm.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:28.620
I see.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.760
So, I've been meaning to ask, who is this churl
that's been sitting next to you all this time?

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.090
This is my stalk—

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.860
My name is Jingu Kyouko!

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.220
I am Jahy-kun's friend!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.750
Huh?!

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:56.380
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.500
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.710
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.880
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.050
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:02.310
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:25.250
Y-Y-You... You're the Great Jahy's <i>friend</i>?

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:27.870
<b>Restoration Plan No. 16

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:29.660
Indeed. Jahy-kun and I share an incredible bond.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.670
Jahy-<i>kun</i>?!

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:36.880
Don't think that a mere human is 
allowed to sit at the Great Jahy's side.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.810
Calm down, Druj.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:42.130
This is one of my human underlings.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:43.800
She just invited herself.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.270
<i>Though I didn't think she'd follow me even 
to our regular update meetings...</i>

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:49.730
How can you say that, Jahy-kun?!

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:52.420
You said we'd always be together!

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.950
That's why I'm here right now!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.440
Or was that a lie?

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.890
Will you put a sock in it?!

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:58.760
How could you?!

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.780
You said you'd love me!

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.240
What?!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.020
<i>What</i> did she just say?

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:06.080
No, I mean, it's really complicated.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.800
Jahy-kun told me that she'd love me so much.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:16.550
You really need to keep 
your delusions in check.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:20.960
There is no way the Great Jahy
 would ever love a human like you.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.470
Shall I feed that rotten brain 
of yours to some demon hounds?

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.940
Hey, I told you to calm down...

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.030
Why don't you try and see if you can?

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.190
And don't you feed into this!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:37.650
Your Greatness, such a rude and deluded
 human is hardly fit to serve you!

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.740
Make no mistake. I am Jahy-kun's friend.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.610
What are you to Jahy-kun anyway?

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.340
I am the Great Jahy's top underling.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:49.280
I've been serving her
 since we were in the Dark Realm.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.740
That's right! Since way before you came along.

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.180
<i>What is this...?</i>

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:04.030
What can a human like you possibly understand
of the Dark Realm's second-in-command?

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:09.310
Not only do I understand her better, 
I am also better equipped to serve her.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.520
Are you, though?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:14.790
In the human world, I've spent more 
time with Jahy-kun than you.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.770
I'm the one who understands her better now.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.700
It's only been a few measly months.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.240
What could you possibly 
have come to understand?

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.700
I understand Jahy-kun better than you!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.700
I understand the Great Jahy better than you!

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:30.160
<i>This is so dumb.</i>

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:35.460
Oh? Well, did you know that she 
loves the slide at the park?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.380
Wha?!

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:40.250
Come now! She adores the gallows far more.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.090
Wha?!

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:44.470
While collecting mana crystals, 
she also collects four leaf clovers!

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.430
Her daily routine involves
stuffing her underlings into a hole!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.920
Nobody pours a better beer than her!

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.650
Nobody casts a better curse!

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:53.830
She's even faster at the register than the boss!

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.330
Actually, insider her braid—

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:57.770
Knock it off!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:01.280
Enough with the garbage! 
You're both talking nonsense!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.740
Neither of you understand me at all!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.200
Then how about this?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.540
The one who collects more 
mana crystals, starting now,

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.920
will be deemed most worthy 
to serve the Great Jahy.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.370
Her <i>true</i> underling.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.220
Hey! That's not for you to decide!

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.980
Fine.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.050
No, it's not!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.630
I'm not okay with this!

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.970
Besides, I thought you wanted to be my friend.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:46.240
I hate to break it to you, but I'm quite 
good at collecting mana crystals.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.230
Oh? As am I.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.620
Is anyone... listening to me?

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.380
Hey? Anyone?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.420
Why don't I show you?

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.550
I'm the best for Jahy-kun!

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.550
I'm the best for the Great Jahy!

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.520
<i>The hell was that?</i>

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.170
<i>They left without listening 
to a single thing I said.</i>

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.480
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.930
<i>If both of them are running out
 to fetch more mana crystals,</i>

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:26.740
<i>that means I'll get two loads' worth
 without having to do anything myself.</i>

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.290
<i>Wow, this is actually a pretty sweet deal!</i>

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:34.090
<i>And with the two loudmouths gone,
it's all wins for me!</i>

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:38.610
Pardon me. Would you like the check now?

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.830
The limit is ten minutes!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:46.920
Whoever collects the most mana 
crystals in that time wins!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.220
That's just perfect!

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:27.480
One, two, three, four, 
five, six, seven, eight...

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.340
You're pretty good at this.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:32.680
So are you.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.400
I won't lose!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.860
Neither will I!

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:39.600
<i>Meanwhile, the Great Jahy was...</i>

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.750
Why aren't those two fools coming back?!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:48.850
<i>...forced to wash dishes to cover the bill.</i>

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.310
Jahy...

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.240
Today is the day I bring you down!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.620
I, Saurva, of the Dark Realm's elite!

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.420
I've failed many times before now.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.630
But things will be different this time.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:14.340
<b>Jahy's normal route!!</b>

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:14.340
I've done meticulous research 
and spent ages preparing.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:19.070
What's more, I have the Dark Realm's
most powerful trap... Chompy-kun!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.180
<b>New Invention<i>!!</i></b>

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.180
<b>CHOMPY-KUN</b>

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.180
<b>(Available in Mark 1 through 3)</b>

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:24.730
She often passes by this spot.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.930
Drawn by the bait, she'll approach 
Chompy-kun only to meet her doom.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.040
Grovel if you want my help.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.520
Oh, Magnificent Saurva, please help me!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.760
You can be second-in-command 
of the Dark Realm!

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:46.580
That's the plan.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.000
Simple, but if I had to say,
 that's what makes it so genius.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:50.880
Huh?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.090
There she is.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:56.310
Now... it's showtime!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.690
Who is that?

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.340
A normal person?

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.680
She just looks like a regular high school girl.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:09.900
Could she be Jahy's underling?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.110
She's way too close to Jahy!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.830
If the Chompy-kun activates, 
this girl might get caught in it, too.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:19.500
I can't allow a citizen 
to be collateral damage.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.950
What should I do?

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.620
What a suspicious thing to 
have in a place like this.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.870
What is this?

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:33.450
Oh, no!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.380
She got herself caught in the trap!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.340
Please help me, Jahy-kun!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.350
So she knows Jahy?

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.810
Look at her!

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.440
She'd make a face like that when
her friend is getting thrashed?

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:50.020
And she's just leaving her?!

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.230
How can she be so evil?!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.940
Jahy-kun!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:57.650
I feel so bad for that poor girl!

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:00.170
Wait, at this rate, she's going to die!

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:02.660
Dark Realm traps are far 
too strong for humans!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.670
Um! Uh...

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:09.330
<i>She's totally fine?</i>

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:12.550
<i>And Chompy-kun Mark 1 
was completely destroyed?!</i>

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:14.840
What is it?

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.100
Nothing.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:20.170
<i>It took so long to build that...</i>

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:23.970
<i>This is strange.</i>

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.710
<i>Did I make it too soft?</i>

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:31.130
<i>This is going too far, even for 
the Dark Realm's second-in-command.</i>

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.910
<i>I'll modify its strength some...</i>

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.320
There it is!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.160
You again?!

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:44.070
And now that I look, despite all your wailing,
 you don't seem hurt at all!

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:46.960
Instead, all you're doing is looking at Jahy!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:47.720
<i>Glance!</i>

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.510
<i>Glance!</i>

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:58.300
<i>She sighs and then ignores her?!</i>

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.750
<i>She looks depressed...</i>

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:09.410
I mean, she seems fine, but that trap 
I made for Jahy, Chompy-kun Mark 2,

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.860
is thirty times stronger than 
Chompy-kun Mark 1 from before.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.310
<b>CHOMPY-KUN Spec Comparison</b>

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.310
<b>Mark 2</b>

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.310
<b>Mark 1</b>

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.660
There's no way she's unscathed—

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.240
Chompy-kun Mark 2!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.950
All my hard work! Destroyed!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.470
Jahy-kun!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.810
Worse yet, that girl looks
 more chipper than ever!

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:29.080
I'm glad she's okay, but...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:29.910
Jahy-kun!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:30.880
Damn it!

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.560
It wasn't supposed to be like this.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:35.630
I made these to get Jahy...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.880
No, it's not over!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:41.870
I've still got the final trap, 
Chompy-kun Mark 3!

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:44.050
I don't care which one of them it gets

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:47.200
so long as I get to see Chompy-kun in action!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.060
Work.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.640
Work!

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.350
Work!

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.360
La, la, la, la, la!

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:58.850
Shift time! Going to work with Jahy-kun!

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:01.780
Yay! Work with Jahy-kun!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:05.950
It didn't work?!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.750
<i>Well, fine.</i>

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.860
<i>At least I've learned that the 
first two versions were too weak.</i>

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:14.370
<i>Now I know for the next time.</i>

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:18.510
<i>Still, I can't believe a 
human girl broke them...</i>

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:22.720
<i>It's virtually impossible
 that I erred in their construction.</i>

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.220
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow! 
Yeowch! Yeowch! Yeowch!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.270
Pain! That hurts!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:37.080
There's nothing wrong with the strength!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.230
I didn't screw up!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.170
I really am a genius!

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.410
Oh, ouch! Yowza!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:44.890
That really, really hurts...

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.820
Jahy-kun, I hear screaming from somewhere...

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.120
Who cares?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.080
We're almost late because you 
keep walking into trouble.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.990
Why am I the only one...?

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:08.300
<i>As always, the Great Jahy never
had a chance to uncover Saurva's schemes.</i>

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.420
All right, Dark Lord.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:24.060
For lunch, you can have the rest of 
the lunch that I left in the fridge.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.410
Wha— When did you start eating that?

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:33.420
See if I care if you get hungry at lunchtime.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.690
I'm going now.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:51.220
Good, I just made it in time.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:03.270
I'm going to the bathroom!

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.690
Let's get class started.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.050
Why did you follow me to school?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.910
Until now, you've been good about 
staying home and watching the house.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.360
Now you be good.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.660
Maybe I should've forced
you to go with Jahy-kun.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:48.360
And if you plug the numbers into 
this formula, it turns into this...

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:49.610
<i>Ever since the Dark Lord 
has started staying with me,</i>

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.610
Can anyone solve it?

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:54.620
<i>my food bill has gone up, the house is 
messier, and I have to do more laundry...</i>

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:58.170
<i>I guess it's true that she's misfortune 
incarnate like the mana crystals...</i>

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.480
<i>There's no end to the trouble.</i>

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.290
<b>Still...</b>

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:02.600
Still...

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:07.510
Jingu-san? Want to eat lunch 
together in the courtyard?

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.390
Sure!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.760
<i>At home and at school...</i>

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.540
<i>I used to always be alone.</i>

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.100
<b>I used to always be alone...</b>

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.720
<i>But now...</i>

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.820
Oh, no!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.530
I forgot my lunch at home!

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.920
D-Dark Lord?

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:40.680
Could it be...

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:44.550
You came to school to bring me my lunch?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:49.920
Hey!

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:05.080
<i>I guess that meant she'll 
be waiting for me back home.</i>

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.320
Jingu-san!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.440
Let's hurry up and go!

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:13.420
R-Right!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.330
You know, you've really changed.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.370
Huh?

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:23.240
Before, you had this totally scary aura.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.340
But lately, you seem so lively.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.050
You also don't get hurt like you used to.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.970
You might be right.

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:40.950
<i>It's because of Jahy-kun and the Dark Lord.</i>

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:46.670
<i>I've got them to thank.</i>

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:51.650
<i>I'm grateful, Dark Lord...</i>

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.040
Oh, did you already eat your lunch?

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.910
Damn you, Dark Lord!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.630
All right. She's not around, is she?

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:28.940
Hanging off of me all day, every day...
It's so pesky and annoying!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.980
Today, I can finally have some me time.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.510
Jahy-kun!

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.850
What are you doing here?!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.140
What do you mean?

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.220
We have work together today.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.010
I know that!

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:46.660
But until then, I'm having some me time!

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.020
That reminds me, Jahy-kun...

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:49.210
Don't ignore what I said!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.710
There's something I'd like to ask you.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.130
I don't know! I don't know anything!

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:58.220
It's about the Dark Lord.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:04.310
You may have a lot of respect for her,

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.670
but to me, she's seems like 
nothing more than a small girl

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.270
who eats, sleeps, and likes to play pranks.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.200
Is she really some powerful entity?

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:16.640
Would you mind telling me 
about your relationship?

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:28.410
You're taking care of her, 
so I'll tell you the story...

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:33.320
The story of how 
the Dark Lord and I came to be.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:41.090
In the Dark Realm, the Dark Lord 
is the paragon of our demonic race.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.620
In other words, our god.

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:48.860
All demons fear and revere her.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:53.710
<i>That</i> is who I served with everything I had.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.870
An offering to our Dark Lord.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.980
Jahy...

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.990
The Dark Lord is pleased!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:10.600
More?

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:11.830
Worship you more?!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.170
Build a castle!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.930
Raise a dais!

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.380
Offer live sacrifices!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:23.140
Any who go against myself and 
the Dark Lord shall be executed!

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.100
So that's how we ruled the Dark Realm.

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:36.570
<i>Uh, it doesn't sound
 like the Dark Lord did much...</i>

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:41.600
I understood exactly what the Demon Lord
 wanted and offered it up to her.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:45.030
In return, she shared more of the 
mana crystal's power with me.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:49.040
I see. The result of 
continually spoiling her...

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.780
is <i>that</i>.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.500
<b>NEET who only eats and sleeps!!</b>

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.940
How dare you call the Dark Lord "that"?!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:58.210
She wasn't all that in the Dark Realm either!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:19:59.850
She did it again today too,

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.470
just like yesterday! She steals my food!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.140
Leaves a giant mess everywhere!

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.600
And then just sleeps like a sloth!

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:12.790
She may be the Dark Lord, 
but I have no idea what she's thinking.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.880
I...

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:20.250
I may have worshiped the Dark Lord 
and used her power to do what I want,

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:24.910
but she herself never acted 
out of selfish desires.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.870
That thing?

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.350
I told you, the Dark Lord's like a god.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:36.550
And she's chosen to stay with you 
of her own volition.

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:41.340
I believe she has a good reason for it.

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:44.040
I hope that's true.

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:52.200
Anyway, let's get to work.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:56.900
TGIF, so it's gonna be busy!
You'd better prepare yourself!

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.110
Right!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.380
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.100
Good work, everyone!

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:31.470
That's what Jahy-kun said, but does 
the Dark Lord really have a reason?

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:40.230
Yeah, of course not.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:42.290
Hey, Dark Lord!

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.480
I told you that those were <i>my</i> snacks!

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.990
And don't fall asleep out here!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.960
<b>The Great Jahy Can't Sleep...</b>
